#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:5
#: afbd6dd850ed4c6885962692aca1ba1f
msgid "SiK Radio — Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "SiK 数传电台——高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:7
#: 1cc96c84a21b42f09522febd17aef278
msgid ""
"This article provides advanced configuration information for the :ref:`SiK "
"Telemetry Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`. It is intended for \"power "
"users\", and those who wish to gain a better understanding of how the radios"
" operate."
msgstr ""
"本文为 :ref:`SiK 数传电台 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` "
"提供高级配置说明，面向「高级用户」及希望深入了解电台工作原理的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:14
#: 944e018a631c4a6d86e2bf2d0fa0b527
msgid ""
"Most users will only need the basic guide and feature overview provided in "
":ref:`SiK Radio v2 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>`."
msgstr ""
"大多数用户只需参阅 :ref:`SiK Radio v2 <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` 中提供的基础指南和功能概述。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:21
#: fd536e05f7294b8da6742ba6379bcb82
msgid "Monitoring the link quality"
msgstr "监控链路质量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:23
#: 06e86bb238fc4ec3a80696d01b564c61
msgid ""
"You can use the MAVLink support in the SiK Radios to monitor the link "
"quality while flying, if your ground station supports it."
msgstr "如果您的地面站支持，可利用 SiK 电台的 MAVLink 支持在飞行过程中实时监控链路质量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:26
#: d8e908b8e1ed45909aec8e10374142d5
msgid ""
"The two key message parameters are ``RADIO.rssi`` and ``RADIO.remrssi``. The"
" first is the RSSI (signal strength) level that the local radio is receiving"
" at. The remrssi parameter is the RSSI that the remote radio is receiving "
"at."
msgstr ""
"两个关键消息参数为 ``RADIO.rssi`` 和 ``RADIO.remrssi``。前者为本地电台的接收信号强度（RSSI）；remrssi "
"参数为远端电台的接收信号强度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:31
#: 4a0be60c20624bf59af90d2022c704c6
msgid ""
"Here is a typical graph of the RSSI levels for a flight at my local flying "
"field."
msgstr "以下是我在当地飞行场地飞行时的典型 RSSI 电平图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:37
#: af9aa46b07c14a6997f2f3bc33ae65a9
msgid ""
"The RSSI value scales approximately as 1.9x the dBm signal strength, plus an"
" offset. See the Si1000 data sheet for the exact mapping between RSSI and "
"dBm received signal strength, or use this approximate formula"
msgstr ""
"RSSI 值约为 dBm 信号强度的 1.9 倍再加上一个偏移量。Si1000 数据手册中有 RSSI "
"与接收信号强度（dBm）之间的精确换算，也可使用以下近似公式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:47
#: 6492f59e81f74809bacfa70754709d8e
msgid ""
"The reason the RSSI varies so much during this flight is that the signal is "
"attenuated when the plane is rolled over in a turn as I was using a simple "
"wire antenna in the plane. The RSSI values for this flight were plenty high "
"enough for the link quality to be excellent throughout the flight using the "
"default radio parameters."
msgstr ""
"此次飞行中 RSSI 变化较大，原因是飞机在转弯侧倾时使用了简单的线天线导致信号衰减。该次飞行的 RSSI "
"值足够高，使用默认电台参数可确保整个飞行过程中链路质量优秀。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:56
#: a28db85a231d468196eed225e0757af5
msgid "Diagnosing range problems"
msgstr "诊断距离问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:58
#: c08f82c864c94589a59f09965884606f
msgid ""
"If you get less range than you would expect from the above information then "
"what you need to do is graph the noise and signal levels from a flight to "
"work out what the problem is."
msgstr "如果实际距离比预期短，需要通过分析飞行中的噪声和信号电平图来找出问题所在。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:62
#: 4ce1347a940a4bd5a17fcf42558f23f4
msgid ""
"The most common source of range problems is noise. Noise is unwanted radio "
"emissions in the same frequency range that your radio is using that "
"interferes with the operation of your radio. The radios have telemetry "
"logging built in to help you diagnose the source of the noise."
msgstr "距离问题最常见的原因是噪声，即在您的电台使用频段内干扰电台工作的杂散无线电辐射。电台内置数传日志功能，可帮助诊断噪声来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:67
#: baaee9332f584898bd5774a6370324b1
msgid ""
"There are three key types of noise that are likely to affect your radios:"
msgstr "影响电台的主要噪声类型有三种："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:70
#: 305ee681fe40424c81d05781d157bdf5
msgid ""
"Noise from the electronics in your aircraft (such as your motor, ESC, "
"autopilot etc)"
msgstr "来自飞行器电子设备的噪声（如电机、ESC、飞控等）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:72
#: 661caa28f3394acfbd23dfa26b7fb116
msgid "Noise from your ground station computer, especially its USB bus"
msgstr "来自地面站电脑（尤其是 USB 总线）的噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:73
#: 8223b9643dc14cc78d03734088e42b10
msgid ""
"Noise from other people operating radios nearby that are on the same "
"frequency as your radios"
msgstr "来自附近其他使用相同频率电台的人员产生的噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:76
#: 19c62acd5a19427286afc3441e7b7279
msgid ""
"To work out what sort of noise you have, open up mission planner and choose "
"the \"telemetry logs\" tab. Then choose **Tlog> Kml or Graph**. When the "
"window pops up choose **Graph Log** and select a log from a test flight with"
" your radios. Wait for the log to load, then choose the following items to "
"log:"
msgstr ""
"要判断噪声类型，请打开 Mission Planner，选择「数传日志」标签，然后选择 **Tlog> Kml or Graph**。弹出窗口后选择 "
"**Graph Log**，并选择一次电台测试飞行的日志。等待日志加载完成后，选择以下项目绘图："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:82
#: 3f855f5011534c0aa7d93cdaccd09bb1
msgid "rssi"
msgstr "rssi"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:83
#: 75ff3eaf916b46d6b1102aea019146a6
msgid "remrssi"
msgstr "remrssi"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:84
#: 95ceda5d4d2c4a6da7374ea98839f94d
msgid "noise"
msgstr "noise"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:85
#: 2717ef68c56c4f04855f4ddc18850d28
msgid "remnoise"
msgstr "remnoise"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:87
#: 156f12d19d7e469a9fe5b072b417f7d7
msgid ""
"Put all 4 values on the one graph. You will end up with a plot like this:"
msgstr "将全部 4 个值绘制在同一图表上，结果如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:93
#: c02ea862af394008b1cbb89c5c2f9d4d
msgid "That graph shows you 4 things:"
msgstr "该图显示了 4 项内容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:95
#: e6d0e4db87f44f7580fe907d76146d41
msgid "the amount of signal being received on the ground"
msgstr "地面接收到的信号强度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:96
#: 013ee26af47d412f8947997085a70ee5
msgid "the amount of signal being received in the aircraft"
msgstr "飞行器接收到的信号强度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:97
#: a62ddc52c2a94a02acf064041b711d77
msgid "the amount of noise being received on the ground"
msgstr "地面接收到的噪声强度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:98
#: 7c93d40c96a54a68823f5950019732a9
msgid "the amount of noise being received in the aircraft"
msgstr "飞行器接收到的噪声强度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:100
#: 609150530ebd4d62aa8420941c5cb59f
msgid ""
"For the best possible range you want the two noise lines to be low, and the "
"two signal lines to be high. In the above graph (taken from my SkyFun with a"
" pair of 3DR 433 radios) you can see that the noise levels in the plane are "
"higher than the noise levels on the ground. Also note that at the start of "
"the flight (before I started the motor) the noise levels on the plane were "
"lower, then they went up after I started the motor. That shows I'm getting "
"some noise from my motor. If I wanted more range I would need to move the "
"radio further from the motor and ESC."
msgstr ""
"要获得最佳距离，应使两条噪声线尽量低，两条信号线尽量高。上图（来自我使用一对 3DR 433 电台飞行 SkyFun "
"的数据）可以看出，飞行器上的噪声电平高于地面噪声电平。还可注意到，在起飞前（启动电机之前）飞行器上的噪声电平较低，启动电机后噪声升高，说明电机带来了噪声干扰。若需增大距离，需将电台移离电机和"
" ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:109
#: 86f0a41463bd4a27a3899fdc834e1a2b
msgid ""
"Perhaps the most common source of noise with the 3DR-433 is noise from the "
"USB bus on your ground station. That shows up as high values for the "
"RADIO.noise value. If you get this, then you could try using a different USB"
" cable, or a different laptop. You can also try using a USB hub between your"
" laptop and your radio."
msgstr ""
"3DR-433 最常见的噪声来源是地面站电脑的 USB 总线，表现为 RADIO.noise 值偏高。若出现此情况，可尝试更换 USB "
"数据线或换用其他笔记本电脑，也可在笔记本与电台之间加接 USB 集线器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:115
#: 17d6d11305954f7fadfc4b02d19cf7b9
msgid ""
"If the 'rssi' and 'noise' levels meet on the graph then you will lose the "
"link. To determine what your range would be, a rough rule of thumb is to "
"subtract the 'rssi' and 'noise' numbers, then divide by 2. That tells you "
"your \"fade margin\" in decibels. For each 6dB of fade margin your range "
"doubles. So if you have 18dB of fade margin, then you will be able to do "
"roughly 8x whatever range you were at when you measured the margin."
msgstr ""
"如果图中「rssi」和「noise」曲线相交，则链路将断开。粗略估算距离范围的经验公式：用「rssi」减去「noise」，再除以 "
"2，得到的是「衰落余量」（单位：dB）。每增加 6dB 衰落余量，距离翻倍。因此若有 18dB 衰落余量，可达到测量余量时距离的约 8 倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:123
#: f260855091ad44a2a188e93189138dd6
msgid ""
"Another key source of range problems is the antenna placement. Your ground "
"station antenna should be well clear of obstructions and a couple of meters "
"off the ground. You may need to build a stand to hold it to get the best "
"range."
msgstr "另一个常见距离问题来源是天线放置。地面站天线应视野开阔、距地面至少两米，可能需要搭建支架以获得最佳距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:129
#: d8fb628b8b2345c3a62611213dddffc2
msgid "Serial and air rates 'one byte form'"
msgstr "串口与空中速率的「单字节格式」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:131
#: 2a5044d4801949e999fcec331054a727
msgid ""
"The ``SERIAL_SPEED`` and ``AIR_SPEED`` parameters are in the same form that "
"ArduPilot uses for the ``SERIAL3_SPEED`` parameter. If the number is greater"
" than 2000, it is the baud rate.  Otherwise, it is the rate in kbps, "
"truncated to an integer. So '9' means 9600 baud, '38' means 38400, '115' "
"means 115200 etc."
msgstr ""
"``SERIAL_SPEED`` 和 ``AIR_SPEED`` 参数与 ArduPilot 中 ``SERIAL3_SPEED`` "
"参数使用相同格式。若数值大于 2000，则表示波特率；否则表示以 kbps 为单位的速率（取整）。例如：'9' 表示 9600 波特，'38' 表示 "
"38400，'115' 表示 115200，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:138
#: dfb36b4de7284b9486b473cdb4df9b75
msgid "Choosing the air data rate"
msgstr "选择空中数据速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:140
#: e2e8daa9fe0d456784e3064a03f4eb95
msgid ""
"The key parameter that controls the range of your radios is the "
"``AIR_SPEED``. The default is 64 (which is 64kbps) will give you a range of "
"over a kilometre with small omni antennas. The lower you set the "
"``AIR_SPEED`` the longer your range, although lowering the ``AIR_SPEED`` "
"also lowers how much data you can send over the link."
msgstr ""
"控制电台距离的关键参数是 ``AIR_SPEED``。默认值为 64（即 "
"64kbps），使用小型全向天线可达到超过一公里的距离。``AIR_SPEED`` 越低，距离越远，但降低 ``AIR_SPEED`` "
"同时也会减少可通过链路传输的数据量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:146
#: 28dbad06c6d04603bc094e07775758dc
msgid ""
"The radio firmware can only support 13 possible air data rates, which are 2,"
" 4, 8, 16, 19, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96, 128, 192 and 250. If your application "
"needs a different air rate for some reason then we can potentially add it to"
" the register tables. If you choose an unsupported air rate then the next "
"highest rate from the supported list will be chosen."
msgstr ""
"电台固件仅支持 13 种空中数据速率：2、4、8、16、19、24、32、48、64、96、128、192 和 "
"250。如果应用需要其他速率，可尝试加入寄存器表。若选择不支持的速率，系统将自动选择支持列表中下一个更高的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:153
#: e25edff2544349d99306e8f4f42a8a05
msgid "What air data rate you choose will depend on the following factors:"
msgstr "选择空中数据速率取决于以下因素："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:155
#: 77a4bff6e795429d8eedc67718e6c274
msgid "What range you need"
msgstr "所需距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:156
#: cf01733ae7be4bff9a66697b34de7dae
msgid "What data rate you will be sending"
msgstr "将要发送的数据速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:157
#: 4e642d69c72f4074afa5403ec20e6496
msgid "Whether you primarily send in one direction, or both"
msgstr "主要是单向还是双向发送"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:158
#: 8b15ba025e0f4e34821615574f2fed1a
msgid "Whether you have ECC enabled"
msgstr "是否启用了 ECC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:160
#: b0bad4a8121d4a8db7d502f6a46d55be
msgid ""
"For most telemetry applications you will primarily be sending data mostly in"
" one direction, from the aircraft to the ground station. For most people, "
"the amount of data sent from the ground station to the aircraft is small, "
"just an occasional control packet plus heartbeat packets."
msgstr "对于大多数数传应用，数据主要从飞行器单向发送至地面站。从地面站发送至飞行器的数据量通常很少，仅为偶发的控制数据包和心跳包。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:166
#: b1f989797950470db013b467740f6fd4
msgid ""
"If you are using a joystick to control your aircraft then you will be "
"sending a lot more data from the ground station to the aircraft, and in that"
" case you may find a higher ``AIR_SPEED`` is needed, although your range "
"will be reduced."
msgstr "如果使用摇杆控制飞行器，则从地面站到飞行器的数据量会增加很多，此时可能需要更高的 ``AIR_SPEED``，但相应距离会缩短。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:171
#: f20e32099702412db07e912e71b87dd5
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The ``ECC`` parameter makes a big difference to the data rate you can "
"support at a given ``AIR_SPEED``. If you have ECC set to zero, then no error"
" correcting information is sent, and the radio uses a simple 16 bit CRC to "
"detect transmission errors. In that case your radio will be able to support "
"data transfers in one direction of around 90% of the ``AIR_SPEED``."
msgstr ""
"``ECC`` 参数对在给定 ``AIR_SPEED`` 下支持的数据速率影响很大。若 ECC 设置为零，则不发送纠错信息，电台使用简单的 16 位 "
"CRC 检测传输错误，此时电台在单方向可支持约 90% ``AIR_SPEED`` 的数据传输速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:178
#: e546f57cb9ca42519607b1b625a89bac
msgid ""
"If you enable ECC, then the data rate you can support is halved. The ECC "
"system doubles the size of the data sent by the radios. It is worth it "
"however, as the bit error rate will drop dramatically, and you are likely to"
" get a much more reliable link at longer ranges."
msgstr ""
"启用 ECC 后，可支持的数据速率减半，因为 ECC 系统会将电台发送的数据量翻倍。但这通常值得，因为误码率会大幅下降，在更远距离上能获得更可靠的链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:184
#: 16229fef63d1466fafa3dab1d5692ba7
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will automatically adapt its telemetry rates to what the radio can"
" handle, by using MAVLink RADIO packets injected into the MAVLink streams by"
" the radio's firmware. That allows you to 'oversubscribe' your link, by "
"setting up a ``SERIAL_SPEED`` larger than what the radios can actually "
"handle."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 会通过电台固件注入 MAVLink 数据流的 MAVLink RADIO "
"数据包，自动将数传速率调整为电台实际能处理的速率。这样您可以通过设置大于电台实际处理能力的 ``SERIAL_SPEED`` 来「超额订阅」链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:190
#: c5b4fade40b14d308f4c8f2fd4e01012
msgid ""
"The other factor in choosing the air data rate is the TDM 'sync time'. The "
"two radios need to work out each others frequency hopping pattern. They do "
"this by slowly changing the receive channel while rapidly changing the "
"transmit channel. This process of getting in sync with the other radio takes"
" just a few seconds at high air data rates, but gets slower for low air data"
" rates."
msgstr ""
"选择空中数据速率时还需考虑 "
"TDM「同步时间」。两部电台需要协商各自的跳频图案，通过缓慢改变接收频道、快速改变发射频道来实现同步。在高空中数据速率下，同步仅需几秒；在低空中数据速率下则需更长时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:197
#: acb76f3826414b94bde5e8e59a6be90b
msgid ""
"For most amateur UAV applications the default ``AIR_SPEED`` of 64 with no "
"ECC enabled will be good."
msgstr "对于大多数业余无人机应用，默认 ``AIR_SPEED`` 64 且不启用 ECC 即可满足需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:201
#: 2e5f9456f0e544d885a9d8585a109026
msgid "Error correction"
msgstr "纠错"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:203
#: 5a38984b407642f99c8bc34227141026
msgid ""
"Using error correction is no longer recommended due to the range reduction "
"and the fact that some newer radio chips are not capable of doing ECC and "
"will fail to function if this option is selected."
msgstr "由于距离缩减问题以及部分新型无线芯片不支持 ECC（选择此选项会导致无法正常工作），不再建议使用纠错功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:205
#: 3d0e723b697843bf84f6741890401bfd
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, the radios support a 12/24 Golay error correcting code "
"if you set the ECC parameter to 1. This means that for every 12 bits of data"
" the radio will send 24 bits, calculating the bits using Golay code lookup "
"tables. The process is reversed on the receiving end, and allows the radio "
"to correct bit errors of up to 3 bits in every 12 bits send (i.e. 25% bit "
"error rate)."
msgstr ""
"如前所述，若将 ECC 参数设置为 1，电台支持 12/24 Golay 纠错码。这意味着每传输 12 位数据，电台将发送 24 位，多余位通过 "
"Golay 码查找表计算得出。接收端逆向处理，使电台能纠正每 12 位中最多 3 位的误码（即 25% 误码率）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:212
#: 85db66ab8e0044319fb70ed02f4e54e1
msgid ""
"The downside of the ECC option is that it halves your available data "
"bandwidth.  In some cases this is worth it, as you are able to sustain a "
"reliable link over longer ranges. You will also get a lot less 'noise' in "
"the serial stream."
msgstr "ECC 选项的缺点是将可用数据带宽减半。在某些情况下，这是值得的，因为可以在更远距离保持可靠链路，同时串口数据流中的「噪声」也会大幅减少。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:218
#: d1b511b1034741caa17fbc5697ba0288
msgid "MAVLink framing"
msgstr "MAVLink 帧格式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:220
#: 6882fd541eaf4bc8834d0d7c5a3d6908
msgid ""
"If you set the MAVLINK option to 1 or 2 then the radio will do 'MAVLink "
"framing'. The MAVLink protocol is used by ArduPilot for transmitting "
"telemetry date to a ground station. When MAVLink framing is used, the radio "
"will try to align radio packets with MAVLink packet boundaries. This means "
"that if a packet is lost you don't end up with half a MAVLink packet being "
"seen by the receiver. That partial packet would appear as line noise on your"
" ground stations console."
msgstr ""
"如果将 MAVLINK 选项设置为 1 或 2，电台将进行「MAVLink 帧封装」。MAVLink 协议由 ArduPilot "
"用于向地面站传输数传数据。启用 MAVLink 帧封装后，电台会尝试将无线数据包与 MAVLink "
"数据包边界对齐，这样当数据包丢失时，接收端不会收到半个 MAVLink 数据包，避免地面站控制台出现乱码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:228
#: a02505f5508e4f29a87e1e44f1dc0c59
msgid ""
"If you set MAVLINK to 2, then in addition to doing MAVLink framing the radio"
" will look for ``RC_OVERRIDE`` packets (used for joysticks) and ensure that "
"those packets get sent as quickly as possible. This option is useful if you "
"are using a tablet based joystick for control."
msgstr ""
"若将 MAVLINK 设置为 2，除了 MAVLink 帧封装外，电台还会检测 ``RC_OVERRIDE`` "
"数据包（用于摇杆控制），并确保这些数据包尽快发送。此选项适用于使用平板摇杆控制的场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:233
#: e3970936ac664ac298d7fb0ada707d81
msgid ""
"The radio firmware will try to fit multiple MAVLink packets into one radio "
"packet where possible for maximum efficiency. The highest radio packet size "
"is 252 bytes."
msgstr "电台固件会在可能的情况下将多个 MAVLink 数据包合并到一个无线数据包中，以最大化效率。无线数据包最大为 252 字节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:237
#: f0c9e0aa473b424a9e05e92213872c7f
msgid ""
"The radio firmware supports both the MAVLink 1.0 and the MAVLink 2.0 "
"transmission formats."
msgstr "电台固件同时支持 MAVLink 1.0 和 MAVLink 2.0 传输格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:241
#: d35355b64d1b4f149ef90d2feb134985
msgid "MAVLink reporting"
msgstr "MAVLink 报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:243
#: e98d22c1aa204f968da591463f44c1a7
msgid ""
"If you have MAVLINK set to 1, then the radio firmware will also look for "
"MAVLink HEARTBEAT messages coming from the serial connection. If it sees a "
"HEARTBEAT message then it knows that the MAVLink protocol is in use, and it "
"will start injecting MAVLink 'RADIO' status packets into the the serial "
"stream."
msgstr ""
"若 MAVLINK 设置为 1，电台固件还会检测串口连接中传来的 MAVLink HEARTBEAT 消息。发现心跳包后，电台知道正在使用 "
"MAVLink 协议，并开始向串口流中注入 MAVLink 'RADIO' 状态数据包。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:249
#: 39f6c2938daf4b59b469f7ce11df53d7
msgid ""
"The RADIO packets contain information about the RSSI (Received Signal "
"Strength Indicator) level at both ends of the link, allowing the ground "
"station or aircraft to take action in case the link quality falls too low."
msgstr "RADIO 数据包包含链路两端的 RSSI（接收信号强度指示）电平信息，使地面站或飞行器能在链路质量过低时采取措施。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:254
#: f32b0653a8594aec89cd24b7635da9f9
msgid ""
"The RADIO packets also contain information about error rates, and how full "
"the serial transmit buffer is (as a percentage). ArduPilot can use this "
"information to automatically adapt the telemetry stream rates to the data "
"rate that the radios can sustain."
msgstr ""
"RADIO 数据包还包含误码率信息及串口发送缓冲区占用百分比。ArduPilot 可利用这些信息自动将数传流速率调整为电台实际能维持的数据速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:260
#: 3a457b493a484efda9dff6b3f10fd60f
msgid "Power levels"
msgstr "发射功率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:262
#: 36863eb18f194ce3ba4092b2bb37fb43
msgid ""
"You need to be very careful to configure your radios to stay within the "
"legal power limits of the country you are operating in. The default power "
"level of 20dBm is fine for the US and Australia, as up to 30dBm is allowed "
"by the LIPD class licenses there in the 915-928MHz frequency band for a "
"frequency hopping radio. So as long as your antennas have a gain of less "
"than 10dBi you should be within the ISM rules."
msgstr ""
"您需要非常注意将电台配置为符合所在国家的法定功率限制。美国和澳大利亚默认功率电平 20dBm 是合规的，因为其 LIPD 类别许可证允许 "
"915-928MHz 频段跳频电台最高 30dBm。因此只要您的天线增益低于 10dBi，应符合 ISM 规定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:269
#: 8f6105636f4e4a208ec73e05213b94a8
msgid ""
"The radio cannot support arbitrary power levels. It can only support the "
"power levels given in the following table"
msgstr "电台不支持任意功率电平，仅支持以下表格中列出的功率电平"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:315
#: 247c5907d2844b0c97e4ba5a6bf29b70
msgid ""
"If you choose an unsupported power level the radio will choose the next "
"highest power level from the above table."
msgstr "若选择不支持的功率电平，电台将选择上表中下一个更高的功率电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:318
#: 441a63aee2da4bb9b1a3eaaf1b3ead4a
msgid ""
"Please carefully check the EIRP (Equivalent isotropically radiated power) "
"power limits for your country, making sure you take into account the antenna"
" gain. The radio is a 'DIY' radio part and it is entirely your "
"responsibility to ensure any use of it is compliant with local rules."
msgstr ""
"请仔细查阅您所在国家的 EIRP（等效全向辐射功率）限制，确保将天线增益计算在内。本电台属于「DIY」无线零件，确保使用符合当地规定完全是您的责任。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:324
#: 63e84588e224473f95ab7c45c8f54464
msgid ""
"For example, if your local rules allow for a maximum of 30dBm (1W) EIRP, "
"then if you use an amplifier with a 12dB transmit gain, and an antenna with "
"3dBi gain, then you will need to set TXPOWER to at most 14."
msgstr ""
"例如，若您当地法规允许最大 30dBm（1W）EIRP，而您使用的放大器有 12dB 发射增益、天线有 3dBi 增益，则 TXPOWER "
"最高只能设置为 14。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:328
#: 5b06270f634e4c75849f90f1573db449
msgid ""
"If you don't know how to calculate it, we've made a tutorial for you here: "
":ref:`Understanding dB, Watts and dBm <common-antenna-"
"design_understanding_db_watts_and_dbm>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您不知道如何计算，我们在此提供了教程：:ref:`Understanding dB, Watts and dBm <common-antenna-"
"design_understanding_db_watts_and_dbm>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:332
#: 0b07a5e00a964959a2c15a08e01cef9e
msgid "Using the AT command set"
msgstr "使用 AT 命令集"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:334
#: 0fdc34e565c04d80ab2b3249d686385d
msgid ""
"The radios support a variant of the Hayes 'AT' modem command set for "
"configuration."
msgstr "电台支持 Hayes 'AT' 调制解调器命令集的变体用于配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:337
#: d8059a5b50504c51978af6f0cac25596
msgid ""
"If you connect with a serial console to a radio at the current serial baud "
"rate, you can tell the radio to enter AT command mode by entering the "
"sequence '+++'. To prevent data being seen as the command sequence there is "
"a guard time required, so make sure you type nothing on the serial link for "
"1 second before and after you enter the sequence."
msgstr ""
"通过串口控制台以当前串口波特率连接电台后，输入序列 '+++' 可使电台进入 AT "
"命令模式。为防止数据被误识别为命令序列，需要等待时间保护，请确保在输入序列前后各等待 1 秒内不发送任何串口数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:343
#: 207d72e5aaa4454a9698b613407541b4
msgid ""
"When you enter AT command mode you will receive a 'OK' prompt from the radio"
" and it will stop displaying data sent from the other radio."
msgstr "进入 AT 命令模式后，电台会发送 'OK' 提示，并停止显示来自另一部电台的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:346
#: 225890171dff42f6966765f64945237d
msgid ""
"Once in AT command mode, you can give the radio either 'AT' commands to "
"control the local radio, or (if successfully connected) you can use 'RT' "
"commands to control the remote radio."
msgstr "进入 AT 命令模式后，可向电台发送 'AT' 命令控制本地电台，或（成功连接时）使用 'RT' 命令控制远端电台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:350
#: 5ef8eb2570fa45b4a063c9e20feb9714
msgid "The AT commands available are:"
msgstr "可用的 AT 命令包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:352
#: 1ee20b99684143a4b10411333f8479a6
msgid "ATI - show radio version"
msgstr "ATI - 显示电台版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:353
#: 78fcaa3045304fc29ad89ee324ecc37d
msgid "ATI2 - show board type"
msgstr "ATI2 - 显示板型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:354
#: 0df97655eee348749550abc4be99aa38
msgid "ATI3 - show board frequency"
msgstr "ATI3 - 显示板子频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:355
#: b950bb00e8044dddb792a81fba5cce1b
msgid "ATI4 - show board version"
msgstr "ATI4 - 显示板子版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:356
#: 0b98108b5edd4d4abda76c301ca98f5f
msgid "ATI5 - show all user settable EEPROM parameters"
msgstr "ATI5 - 显示所有用户可设置的 EEPROM 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:357
#: 285314dcadf44b2488b70a4c736995b6
msgid "ATI6 - display TDM timing report"
msgstr "ATI6 - 显示 TDM 时序报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:358
#: cac706d2d4624c698380d6635560baf6
msgid "ATI7 - display RSSI signal report"
msgstr "ATI7 - 显示 RSSI 信号报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:359
#: 734d891f7a684419adfcde6f4b897f79
msgid "ATO - exit AT command mode"
msgstr "ATO - 退出 AT 命令模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:360
#: a9491ce8cf084dbb8a4406de44dd0d97
msgid "ATSn? - display radio parameter number 'n'"
msgstr "ATSn? - 显示编号为 'n' 的电台参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:361
#: c3e41b074b704ae5a63c4e6066d23ad8
msgid "ATSn=X - set radio parameter number 'n' to 'X'"
msgstr "ATSn=X - 将编号为 'n' 的电台参数设置为 'X'"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:362
#: 616e14d6c90541d4a01531c5835e85ac
msgid "ATZ - reboot the radio"
msgstr "ATZ - 重启电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:363
#: 48d26e5f7b0b45e18b142791d74348e5
msgid "AT&W - write current parameters to EEPROM"
msgstr "AT&W - 将当前参数写入 EEPROM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:364
#: aaed0548224b409bac09c711c528b6bb
msgid "AT&F - reset all parameters to factory default"
msgstr "AT&F - 将所有参数恢复出厂默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:365
#: 923abae865fa486997ac9aea97b135c0
msgid "AT&T=RSSI - enable RSSI debug reporting"
msgstr "AT&T=RSSI - 启用 RSSI 调试报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:366
#: cbfb0f74fbea414d8255741033d78b0e
msgid "AT&T=TDM - enable TDM debug reporting"
msgstr "AT&T=TDM - 启用 TDM 调试报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:367
#: d908ded7f8f44e3ea152893e969b68d4
msgid "AT&T - disable debug reporting"
msgstr "AT&T - 禁用调试报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:369
#: 4dc438506f014f1f8f18ee2f56736be8
msgid ""
"all of these commands, except for ATO, may be used on a connected remote "
"radio by replacing 'AT' with 'RT'."
msgstr "上述所有命令（除 ATO 外）均可通过将 'AT' 替换为 'RT' 在已连接的远端电台上使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:372
#: 4441b01563334b50994813441967a386
msgid ""
"Perhaps the most useful command is 'ATI5' which displays all user settable "
"EEPROM parameters. That will produce a report like this:"
msgstr "最常用的命令可能是 'ATI5'，它会显示所有用户可设置的 EEPROM 参数，输出格式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:394
#: f3deef35066e42d79f5f994030a1b267
msgid ""
"The first column is the S register to set if you want to change that "
"parameter. So for example, to set the transmit power to 10dBm, use "
"'ATS4=10'."
msgstr "第一列为要修改该参数时需设置的 S 寄存器号。例如，要将发射功率设为 10dBm，使用 'ATS4=10'。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:398
#: 9f95cc8897b34a5995a0061d84369c0f
msgid ""
"Most parameters only take effect on the next reboot. So the usual pattern is"
" to set the parameters you want, then use 'AT&W' to write the parameters to "
"EEPROM, then reboot using 'ATZ'. The exception is the transmit power, which "
"changes immediately (although it will revert to the old setting on reboot "
"unless you use AT&W)."
msgstr ""
"大多数参数仅在下次重启后生效。通常的操作流程是：设置所需参数，使用 'AT&W' 将参数写入 EEPROM，然后用 'ATZ' "
"重启。例外是发射功率，会立即生效（但若不使用 AT&W，重启后会恢复旧值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:404
#: 9f30254b0e6d4902aead1580cfe15c76
msgid "The meaning of the parameter is as follows:"
msgstr "参数含义如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:406
#: 482948bb5e964e1dbde99b1940cb8e3e
msgid "``FORMAT`` - this is for EEPROM format version. Don't change it"
msgstr "``FORMAT`` - EEPROM 格式版本，请勿修改"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:407
#: e3b2bd687f9545b28e438df0fba90465
msgid ""
"``SERIAL_SPEED`` - this is the serial speed in 'one byte form' (see below)"
msgstr "``SERIAL_SPEED`` - 「单字节格式」串口速率（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:409
#: 05fd3bdc1f4341b28a09adbe96a49dc3
msgid "``AIR_SPEED`` - this is the air data rate in 'one byte form'"
msgstr "``AIR_SPEED`` - 「单字节格式」空中数据速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:410
#: e2e346a89a6e4117815dd002a255e72b
msgid ""
"``NETID`` - this is the network ID. It must be the same for both your radios"
msgstr "``NETID`` - 网络 ID，两部电台必须相同"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:412
#: 2cf8374f529f41b88a49920052fe9ea4
msgid "``TXPOWER`` - this is the transmit power in dBm. The maximum is 20dBm"
msgstr "``TXPOWER`` - 发射功率（dBm），最大值为 20dBm"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:413
#: 4883f843aaac43d3be936bca0b144069
msgid "``ECC`` - this enables/disables the golay error correcting code"
msgstr "``ECC`` - 启用/禁用 Golay 纠错码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:414
#: 91fec6fc639b4589a3e783efa2a9e415
msgid ""
"``MAVLINK`` - this controls MAVLink framing and reporting. 0=no MAVLink "
"framing, 1=frame mavlink, 2=low latency mavlink"
msgstr ""
"``MAVLINK`` - 控制 MAVLink 帧封装与报告：0=不封装 MAVLink，1=封装 MAVLink，2=低延迟 MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:416
#: 34ddd256b3ec4aaf9849aeec07453961
msgid "``MIN_FREQ`` - minimum frequency in kHz"
msgstr "``MIN_FREQ`` - 最低频率（kHz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:417
#: 4cace10f14ac45558f8f86c29b1b35bf
msgid "``MAX_FREQ`` - maximum frequency in kHz"
msgstr "``MAX_FREQ`` - 最高频率（kHz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:418
#: d77770d433674a69896ea67cbbd74c10
msgid "``NUM_CHANNELS`` - number of frequency hopping channels"
msgstr "``NUM_CHANNELS`` - 跳频信道数量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:419
#: dcad470ff31246d89ccd62e0adb3e187
msgid "``DUTY_CYCLE`` - the percentage of time to allow transmit"
msgstr "``DUTY_CYCLE`` - 允许发射的时间占比（%）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:420
#: d91295cd48a0421188c25d9cf9a9ab1e
msgid "``LBT_RSSI`` - Listen Before Talk threshold (see docs below)"
msgstr "``LBT_RSSI`` - 先听后讲阈值（见下文说明）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:421
#: 7675dab7a0ed46abbf4ffcd27dae46ff
msgid ""
"``MAX_WINDOW`` - max transmit window in msecs, 131 is the default, 33 "
"recommended for low latency (but lower bandwidth)"
msgstr "``MAX_WINDOW`` - 最大发射窗口（毫秒），默认 131，建议低延迟时设为 33（但带宽会降低）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:424
#: 8c6d0844b6fe4a02a1fe4118cae67fe7
msgid ""
"For two radios to communicate the following must be the same at both ends of"
" the link:"
msgstr "两部电台通信时，链路两端以下参数必须相同："

