msgstr "可用频率范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:443
#: 18837b31f4fa4f26869bf68bb7a0b5b6
msgid ""
"The following table may be helpful matching your local radio regulations to "
"the two radio models available"
msgstr "以下表格可帮助将您当地的无线法规与两种电台型号进行匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:469
#: 622307dea9e44e5a9913f7ab5da55826
msgid "DUTY_CYCLE setting"
msgstr "DUTY_CYCLE 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:471
#: 57743daed67a494385df6c50757011b8
msgid ""
"Most users will want to set the ``DUTY_CYCLE`` to 100. The ``DUTY_CYCLE`` is"
" the maximum percentage of time that the radio will transmit packets."
msgstr "大多数用户应将 ``DUTY_CYCLE`` 设置为 100。``DUTY_CYCLE`` 是电台发射数据包的最大时间占比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:475
#: db383d73a9ae4425ba1de2e238d8bb60
msgid ""
"The reason the duty cycle is included is that some regions of the world "
"allow for higher transmit power or more frequencies if you have a duty cycle"
" below a given threshold. So for example in Europe you can transmit on a "
"wider range of frequencies in the 433 band if your duty cycle is below 10%."
msgstr ""
"设置占空比的原因是，全球部分地区在占空比低于某一阈值时允许更高的发射功率或更多频率。例如，在欧洲，若占空比低于 10%，可以在 433 "
"频段使用更宽的频率范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:481
#: 69db4825c37542cd87a8b30aec047491
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"When you set a duty cycle below 100% then your available bandwidth will be "
"reduced, so you will find it will only work well for telemetry at higher "
"baud rates. It is still quite practical to get good telemetry from ArduPilot"
" with a 10% duty cycle, as telemetry traffic is quite 'bursty', so the "
"average transmit time is not generally high anyway."
msgstr ""
"将占空比设置低于 100% 时，可用带宽会减少，因此数传只能在较高波特率下正常工作。但实际上以 10% 占空比仍然可以从 ArduPilot "
"获得良好数传，因为数传流量本身是「突发性」的，平均发射时间通常并不高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:487
#: 5c853b960e7b40dda0cf4bc733b8d950
msgid ""
"For example, you can easily receive all telemetry streams at 2Hz with "
"``AIR_SPEED`` set to 128, ECC enabled and ``DUTY_CYCLE`` set to 10."
msgstr ""
"例如，将 ``AIR_SPEED`` 设为 128、启用 ECC 并将 ``DUTY_CYCLE`` 设为 10，可轻松以 2Hz 接收所有数传流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:490
#: 1a761882774e439ebe099b1a01721772
msgid ""
"You can also set a radio to receive only by setting the ``DUTY_CYCLE`` to 0."
" That will work best if you set ``NUM_CHANNELS`` to a low number, as "
"otherwise the clock synchronisation will be poor."
msgstr ""
"也可将 ``DUTY_CYCLE`` 设为 0 使电台仅接收。此时最好将 ``NUM_CHANNELS`` 设为较小值，否则时钟同步会较差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:497
#: 85d0d9d3fcbd41419a908406aa1160bc
msgid "Low latency mode"
msgstr "低延迟模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:499
#: 474ec6c7dfdc47ccb7f33bb118ede3ba
msgid ""
"The radio can be configured to use 'low latency mode' to improve performance"
" for things like tablet based joysticks etc... The two parameters you should"
" set to enable this mode are as follows:"
msgstr "电台可配置为「低延迟模式」，以改善平板摇杆等应用的性能。启用此模式的两个参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:503
#: 5542938cb341423e826181e9cd7224e5
msgid ""
"Set ``MAVLINK`` to 2. This turns on special checking for the ``RC_OVERRIDE``"
" packets used in joystick control, to allow those packets to always be sent "
"first. If you are using MAVLink (you probably are) there are no downsides "
"for choosing this setting."
msgstr ""
"将 ``MAVLINK`` 设置为 2。这将开启对摇杆控制所用 ``RC_OVERRIDE`` "
"数据包的特殊检测，确保这些数据包始终优先发送。如果您在使用 MAVLink（大概率是），此设置没有任何缺点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:507
#: 5f1e47830dda4d3f93fab7f56cb89fc8
msgid ""
"Change ``MAX_WINDOW`` from the default of 131 to 33. This will ensure that "
"the GCS can send a packet to the vehicle at least once every 33 msecs. It is"
" worth noting that this will lower the available bandwidth, so if you need "
"absolute maximum bandwidth you are best off with the default of 131. **Both "
"radios on a channel must have the same value for this parameter, or they "
"will not be able to talk to each other.**"
msgstr ""
"将 ``MAX_WINDOW`` 从默认值 131 改为 33。这将确保地面站至少每 33 "
"毫秒能向飞行器发送一个数据包。需注意这会降低可用带宽，若需最大带宽则保持默认值 131。**同一信道的两部电台此参数值必须相同，否则无法通信。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:516
#: 5aef43dd463b43ca90526796031fd3bd
msgid "Listen Before Talk (LBT)"
msgstr "先听后讲（LBT）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:518
#: b53763a52c144eceac877a324329968d
msgid ""
"The radio can implement 'listen before talk' (LBT) functionality to allow it"
" to comply with a wider range of regional regulatory requirements. LBT is a "
"system where the radio is required to listen for a period of time and see no"
" signal from other radios before it is allowed to transmit. By using a non-"
"zero ``LBT_RSSI`` value your radio will become more 'polite', by waiting "
"until everyone else has stopped transmitting before starting to transmit "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"电台可实现「先听后讲」（LBT）功能，以符合更广泛的地区性监管要求。LBT "
"是一种机制：电台在发射前需监听一段时间，确认没有其他电台信号后才允许发射。通过设置非零的 ``LBT_RSSI`` "
"值，您的电台会更「礼貌」，等待所有其他电台停止发射后再开始发射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:526
#: 8243a3bf305b4665beef09e5f0ea7712
msgid ""
"To enable LBT in your radio you need to set the ``LBT_RSSI`` threshold. This"
" is the signal strength that the radio considers to be an indication that "
"the channel is busy. If you set ``LBT_RSSI`` to zero then LBT is disabled."
msgstr "要启用 LBT，需设置 ``LBT_RSSI`` 阈值，即电台认为信道繁忙的信号强度。将 ``LBT_RSSI`` 设为零则禁用 LBT。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:531
#: 3aae37a01380458299cab24cf39df099
msgid ""
"The minimum non-zero setting is 25 which is a few dB above the receive "
"sensitivity of the radio (-121 dBm). To setup ``LBT_RSSI`` you need to know "
"what signal level your local radio regulations require for LBT "
"functionality. Each increment in LBT_RSSI above 25 is roughly equal to 0.5dB"
" above the radios receive sensitivity. So if you set LBT_RSSI to 40 then the"
" radio will consider the channel to be free if the signal strength is less "
"than 7.5dB above the receiver sensitivity."
msgstr ""
"最小非零值为 25，比电台接收灵敏度（-121 dBm）高几 dB。设置 ``LBT_RSSI`` 时需了解当地无线法规对 LBT "
"功能要求的信号电平。LBT_RSSI 高于 25 的每个增量约等于接收灵敏度上方 0.5dB。例如将 LBT_RSSI 设为 "
"40，则电台在信号强度低于接收灵敏度上方 7.5dB 时认为信道空闲。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:539
#: 1db713aa7a244bd699f7616b26d93c29
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use this formula to get the received signal strength "
"in dBm:"
msgstr "也可使用以下公式将接收信号强度换算为 dBm："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:546
#: 457c967ba1504964b02e0b4fcee8079c
msgid ""
"This formula is approximate, but quite close. See the Si1000 data sheet for "
"a more precise graph."
msgstr "此公式为近似值，但相当接近。更精确的图表请参阅 Si1000 数据手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:549
#: ce2e5faa192d46b8a1a7d38d57f36ac7
msgid ""
"You will need to lookup your local regulatory requirements to see what "
"``LBT_RSSI`` setting you should use."
msgstr "您需要查阅当地法规以确定应使用的 ``LBT_RSSI`` 设置值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:552
#: 6c0a81f7d9a747918714c286f42c64fe
msgid ""
"The LBT implementation in the radio uses a minimum listen time of 5ms, plus "
"randomised listen time as per the European 9.2.2.2 rules."
msgstr "电台中的 LBT 实现使用最少 5ms 的监听时间，加上按照欧洲 9.2.2.2 规则的随机监听时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-technical-information.rst:555
#: 1b0ac1a63c7a45569be36f2115100d24
msgid ""
"Note that in many regions you need to implement LBT in conjunction with AFA "
"(Adaptive Frequency Agility). The radio implements AFA as long as you have "
"``NUM_CHANNELS`` set to more than 1."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在很多地区您可能需要将 LBT 与 AFA（自适应频率捷变）结合使用。只要将 ``NUM_CHANNELS`` 设置为大于 1，电台即实现了 "
"AFA。"

